With this in mind, you are tasked to prove the following target statement.

Target Problem (your task):

\begin{theorem}
            \label{thm:regret-bound-joint-ads}
                Consider revenue-maximization in the joint ad problem against the stochastic i.i.d. adversary. The regret of $\augment$ is at most $C\sqrt{T \log^3 T}$, for some constant $C$.
            \end{theorem}

